start: mr
R1: 3ch=dc ch {[dc ch]x11}@ring ss@top
R2: {3ch=dc dc}@same 2ch [dc2tog@sp 2ch]x11 ss@top # sc+ch1+dc = first dc2tog
R3: sc@sp [7ch sc@sp 3ch sc@sp 3ch sc@sp]x3 7ch sc@sp 3ch sc@sp 3ch ss@top
R4: {sc ch=dc 4dc 3ch 5dc}@same [sc@sp 4ch sc@sp {5dc 3ch 5dc}@same]x3 sc@sp 4ch sc@sp ss@top
R5: 3ch=dc 3dc {2dc 3ch 2dc}@same [4dc 4ch sc@sp 4ch sk 4dc {2dc 3ch 2dc}@same]x3 4dc 4ch sc@sp 4ch ss@top
R6: 3ch=dc 3dc {2dc 3ch 2dc}@same [4dc [4ch sc@sp]x2 4ch 2sk 4dc {2dc 3ch 2dc}@same]x3 4dc [4ch sc@sp]x2 4ch ss@top
R7: {3ch=dc dc}@same 6dc {2dc 3ch 2dc}@same [6dc 2dc@sp 4ch sc@sp 4ch 2dc@sp 6dc {2dc 3ch 2dc}@same]x3 6dc 2dc@sp 4ch sc@sp 4ch 2dc@sp ss@top
R8: {3ch=dc}@same 7dc {2dc 3ch 2dc}@same [10dc 2dc@sp ch 2dc@sp 10dc {2dc 3ch 2dc}@same]x3 10dc 2dc@sp ch 2dc@sp 2dc ss@top
R9: 10sc {2sc 3ch 2sc}@same [29sc {2sc 3ch 2sc}@same]x3 19sc ss@top # side counts derived from R8, text says "sc in each st around"
